  "term": "charlatan",
  "definition": "A charlatan is a person seen as using showy or misleading claims and tricks to seem more skilled or effective than they really are, especially in medical practice. In this historical passage, the word is used critically for a doctor thought to exaggerate results and employ such arts.",
